{"text": "Three Bad Cakes.\n\nElif had no card. But she had half a card and a good memory. She watched Aunt Füsun make the cake many times.\n\n\"I can do this,\" she said. Then she laughed. \"No. I can make this.\"\n\nOn Saturday morning, she made her first cake. She used two lemons, like the card said. After forty minutes, she took it out of the oven.\n\nIt looked perfect. She ate a piece.\n\nIt was very sour! Her face looked like Limon's face in the rain.\n\n\"It's more sour than a lemon,\" said Bora. He took a photo.\n\nFor the second cake, Elif used one lemon and less butter. It wasn't sour this time. But it was dry. It was drier than an old shoe.\n\nFor the third cake, she added more sugar. It was sweet. It was much too sweet. It was sweeter than Mr Selim's cakes.\n\nThree cakes, and three bad cakes. Elif sat down on the kitchen floor. The contest was tomorrow.\n\nAunt Füsun came into the kitchen. She tried a little piece of each cake. Then she started to make lunch.\n\nElif watched her. Aunt Füsun put oil in a pan, then onions, then tomatoes. She added a little of this and a little of that. She never looked at a card, a book or a phone.\n\nThen Elif understood something. She opened her notebook. \"Clue three: Aunt Füsun never cooks from paper.\"\n\nSo why was there a card in the box?\n\nIn the early evening, Elif heard voices behind the restaurant. Theo and Aunt Füsun sat at a small table outside.\n\n\"Good evening, Theo,\" said Aunt Füsun slowly. She said it in English!\n\nTheo answered her in Turkish. Then they both laughed.\n\nSo that was Theo's secret! Every morning at six, they had a lesson. Aunt Füsun taught Theo Turkish. Theo taught Aunt Füsun English. The lemon was for her lessons. She paid him with cake.\n\nElif put a line through Theo's name.\n\nThat night, Elif couldn't sleep. At midnight, she went down for some water. There was a light in the kitchen.\n\nAunt Füsun stood by the oven. She didn't look surprised.\n\n\"Are you ready?\" she asked. In English.", "textSha256": "243047a3930347323ea8bd741aef21662287a18f830b49dba92eb3f52ebc43a7", "voice_id": "EXAVITQu4vr4xnSDxMaL", "model_id": "eleven_v3", "speed": 0.95, "lang": "en", "parts": 1, "alignment": {"characters": ["T", "h", "r", "e", "e", " ", "B", "a", "d", " ", "C", "a", "k", "e", "s", ".", "\n", "\n", "E", "l", "i", "f", " ", "h", "a", "d", " ", "n", "o", " ", "c", "a", "r", "d", ".", " ", "B", "u", "t", " ", "s", "h", "e", " ", "h", "a", "d", " ", "h", "a", "l", "f", " ", "a", " ", "c", "a", "r", "d", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "a", " ", "g", "o", "o", "d", " ", "m", "e", "m", "o", "r", "y", ".", " ", "S", "h", "e", " ", "w", "a", "t", "c", "h", "e", "d", " ", "A", "u", "n", "t", " ", "F", "ü", "s", "u", "n", " ", "m", "a", "k", "e", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "c", "a", "k", "e", " ", "m", "a", "n", "y", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "s", ".", "\n", "\n", "\"", "I", " ", "c", "a", "n", " ", "d", "o", " ", "t", "h", "i", "s", ",", "\"", " ", "s", "h", "e", " ", "s", "a", "i", "d", ".", " ", "T", "h", "e", "n", " ", "s", "h", "e", " ", "l", "a", "u", "g", "h", "e", "d", ".", " ", "\"", "N", "o", ".", " ", "I", " ", "c", "a", "n", " ", "m", "a", "k", "e", " ", "t", "h", "i", "s", ".", "\"", "\n", "\n", "O", "n", " ", "S", "a", "t", "u", "r", "d", "a", "y", " ", "m", "o", "r", "n", "i", "n", "g", ",", " ", "s", "h", "e", " ", "m", "a", "d", "e", " ", "h", "e", "r", " ", "f", "i", "r", "s", "t", " ", "c", "a", "k", "e", ".", " ", "S", "h", "e", " ", "u", "s", "e", "d", " ", "t", "w", "o", " ", "l", "e", "m", "o", "n", "s", ",", " ", "l", "i", "k", "e", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "c", "a", "r", "d", " ", "s", "a", "i", "d", ".", " ", "A", "f", "t", "e", "r", " ", "f", "o", "r", "t", "y", " ", "m", "i", "n", "u", "t", "e", "s", ",", " ", "s", "h", "e", " ", "t", "o", "o", "k", " ", "i", "t", " ", "o", "u", "t", " ", "o", "f", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "o", "v", "e", "n", ".", "\n", "\n", "I", "t", " ", "l", "o", "o", "k", "e", "d", " ", "p", "e", "r", "f", "e", "c", "t", "